 'Choose the word that best completes the sentence: "The detective''s ___ observations helped solve the case."',
 '[{"text":"Astute","isCorrect":true},{"text":"Careless","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Vague","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Trivial","isCorrect":false}]'::jsonb,
